WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Act 1.

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:06.570
A feast roars in the hall, but
Macbeth slips out alone to think.

3
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.630
He piles up the reasons
not to kill Duncan.

4
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:10.670
He's his king.

5
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:11.850
He's his guest.

6
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.370
He's a good king.

7
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:18.170
So he tells his wife: "We will
proceed no further in this business".

8
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.750
Minutes later, he's ready to do it.

9
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.180
So why does he go ahead anyway?

10
00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:26.470
In this mission, you'll weigh
his case against the murder,

11
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.040
line by line.

12
00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:32.320
You'll listen in on his asides,
words no one else on stage can hear,

13
00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:34.270
and ask what they give away.

14
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.590
And you'll track what happens to
his doubts as the crimes pile up.

15
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:42.190
Your mission: explain
why he does it anyway.
